  uint32 t length   table length     1 size t 0 length expect eq table add accept copy expect eq table size    max   
  expect eq table getindex accept  first  1   
    
  max   8  
  capacity   accept bytes     max  
  table setcapacity capacity   
 
  expect le table length    table getmaxtablelength capacity    
    
  expect eq table getindex accept  first  1   
  
 
